    <name>Endurance L08A - Upper Z2 45 min @ 75%</name>
    <description>Endurance - level 8 of 10, variant A. Upper Z2 45 min @ 75%.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 45 min @ 75%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: The very top of Zone 2 for 45 minutes. Still aerobic, but no longer easy.

Estimated TSS: 49.</description>
